# Advance Payment Module — Walkthrough

## Summary

Implemented a complete Advance Payment (Token) module — **17 files** created/modified across backend and frontend. Then **refined the frontend pages** to match the application's native patterns exactly.

---

## Native Redesign (Latest)

Rewrote [AdvancePaymentsPage.jsx](file:///d:/Client%20Projects/Fortunate%20Business%20Management/fortunate-business-management/src/features/advance-payments/AdvancePaymentsPage.jsx) and [AdvancePaymentDetailsPage.jsx](file:///d:/Client%20Projects/Fortunate%20Business%20Management/fortunate-business-management/src/features/advance-payments/AdvancePaymentDetailsPage.jsx) to match established patterns from `CustomersPage` and `LCDetailsPage`.

### List Page — Changes Made

| Before (Generic) | After (Native) |
|---|---|
| Raw `<input>` for search | `InputField` component with `icon={Search}` prop |
| Custom status tab buttons | `SelectField` in filter panel + `Filter` toggle button |
| Inline Previous/Next buttons | [Pagination](file:///d:/Client%20Projects/Fortunate%20Business%20Management/fortunate-business-management/src/components/ui/Pagination.jsx#6-93) component |
| Manual `setTimeout` debounce | `useDebounce` hook |
| Custom colored status pills | [StatusBadge](file:///d:/Client%20Projects/Fortunate%20Business%20Management/fortunate-business-management/src/components/ui/StatusBadge.jsx#14-97) component |
| `shadow-sm` on cards | `border border-gray-200` |
| `bg-blue-600` colors | `var(--color-primary)` CSS variables |
| No loading skeleton | [SkeletonRow](file:///d:/Client%20Projects/Fortunate%20Business%20Management/fortunate-business-management/src/features/advance-payments/AdvancePaymentsPage.jsx#42-67) cards matching `CustomerCard` pattern |
| Header in white card | Bare header like `CustomersPage` |

### Details Page — Changes Made

| Before (Generic) | After (Native) |
|---|---|
| Custom `InfoItem` component | [DataField](file:///d:/Client%20Projects/Fortunate%20Business%20Management/fortunate-business-management/src/components/ui/DataField.jsx#6-74) component with `format` and `icon` props |
| Plain `<div>` sections | `CollapsibleCard` with icon and `ariaLabel` |
| Custom status colored spans | [StatusBadge](file:///d:/Client%20Projects/Fortunate%20Business%20Management/fortunate-business-management/src/components/ui/StatusBadge.jsx#14-97) component |
| No loading skeleton | `ValueSkeleton` component |
| Plain text "Created by" | `AuditInfoSection` component |
| Simple `<div>` header | `motion.div` header with icon box (`p-2 bg-[var(--color-primary)]`) |
| Direct delete with `ConfirmationModal` | `ConfirmationModal` with `confirmModal` state pattern (same as `LCDetailsPage`) |
| `text-blue-600` hardcoded | `text-[var(--color-primary)]` variables |

